e hover box holds it; the spinner, `aria-disabled` and no menu while that remove is queued or running). A change GitLab did not make is one `peopleChangeText` sentence (`personState` under the listed person for a remove, else `groupNotices` under the group). Every control of a line carries `data-control`, its key built once on the line (`BoxLine`'s `review.rerequest.control` and `menuControl`, null when not shown) and bound by the template; when a reply removes the focused one (`lineControls` over the same lines), focus moves to the box.
